      "DS14791 Rev 9",
      "RM0486 Rev 4 chapter 26 (CRC) + memory map p.176"
    ],
    "hsi_contract": "RM0486 Rev 4 ch.26 CRC register interface + memory map p.176 (CRC secure base 0x56024C00)",
    "safety_allocation": "NOT_PROVIDED: no owner safety scope recorded for the CRC benchmark work orders"
  },
  "scope": [
    "HAL (classic, handle-based) as delivered by ST: CRC_HandleTypeDef with its Instance (the CMSIS device structure CRC, stm32n6xx.h) and Init configuration; HAL_StatusTypeDef results; the HAL framework headers stm32n6xx_hal.h / stm32n6xx_hal_def.h and ST's stm32n6xx_hal_conf_template.h configured with the CRC module only (USE_FULL_ASSERT off, as delivered: assert_param is a no-op)",
    "Initialisation and de-initialisation of the calculation unit from the handle configuration: default or user polynomial (CRC_POL, CRC_CR.POLYSIZE), default or user initial value (CRC_INIT), input reversal (CRC_CR.REV_IN with CRC_CR.RTYPE_IN) and output reversal (CRC_CR.REV_OUT with CRC_CR.RTYPE_OUT); the handle state",
    "CRC of a buffer from the initial value (HAL_CRC_Calculate: resets the calculation unit, CRC_CR.RESET) and accumulated over buffers (HAL_CRC_Accumulate), for 32-bit words, 16-bit half-words and 8-bit bytes (CRC_DR accesses of the matching width); the polynomial and reversal settings changed through the extended API (HAL_CRCEx_)",
    "Out of scope: the MSP hooks HAL_CRC_MspInit/HAL_CRC_MspDeInit (weak, empty as delivered: the integrator's clock and reset configuration), interrupts, DMA, the independent data register, register callbacks (USE_HAL_CRC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS off)"
  ],
  "system_names": [
    "CRC HAL driver",
    "CRC driver",
    "STM32N6 CRC HAL driver"
  ],
